<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH SNS GROEP H1 NET PROFIT RISES OVER 20 PCT.</title>
<headline>DUTCH SNS GROEP H1 NET PROFIT RISES OVER 20 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    62.0  vs  52.0</p>
<p>    Total income			 371    vs 328</p>
<p>    Interest gains		     936    vs 818</p>
<p>    Interest charges		   668    vs 578</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    82    vs  67</p>
<p>    Tax				     20    vs  15</p>
<p>    Depreciations			 27    vs  22</p>
<p>Note - SNS Groep said it expected, barring unforeseen</p>
<p>circumstances, the latter half of 1996 to show a higher net</p>
<p>profit than the corresponding period in 1995. The percentage</p>
<p>rise is, however, not expected to match that of the first-half.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 - 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
